// Title: Suspicious File Drop by Exchange
// Rule ID: 6b269392-9eba-40b5-acb6-55c882b20ba6
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1190, attack.initial-access, attack.t1505.003
// Category: file_event
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: azure_monitor
